*20
	08-D2GF
	 
	FAMILY OF 8 HIGH-SPEED PUNCH 
	AND READER TESTS
	 
	ST ADD
	LOC 200
	 
	SW SET
	SR0 HLT ROUT END
	SR1 SEL ROUT IN SR8-SR11
	SR2 LOOP PROG
	SR3 0=HLT ON ERR
	SR4 SKP TST AFTER ERR
	SR5 SCOPE LOOP AFTER ERR
	SR6 0=STALL RAN 1=RUN FULL SPEED
	SR7 LOCK ON STALL  SR6 MUST=0
	 
	NOTE SR SET DO NOT NECESSARILY  APPLY TO ALL PROG IN HSRDPUP TEST
